{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Kellan Graves</strong>, a battle-hardened soldier from Echo-6. After a brutal fall into the depths of the alien world Elior, you find yourself trapped in a vast cave system, haunted by monstrous creatures and the remnants of a failed expedition. Armed only with your pistol and your resolve, you must fight, explore, and uncover the truth hidden in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/8a7fcf76f6d3728a52d1b213cb563cb0.poster.avif?t=1762257626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/8a7fcf76f6d3728a52d1b213cb563cb0.webm?t=1762257626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/8a7fcf76f6d3728a52d1b213cb563cb0.mp4?t=1762257626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the abyss</strong> \u2013 claustrophobic tunnels, deadly enemies, and no way back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure sci-fi horror</strong> \u2013 gritty atmosphere inspired by classics like Doom 3 and F.E.A.R. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist arsenal</strong> \u2013 one pistol, limited ammo, and your determination. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling</strong> \u2013 notes, ruins, and lost technology reveal the fate of Echo-4. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3\u20134 hours of intense gameplay</strong> \u2013 a complete story-driven experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/0f13a22a9b4f262f62a073c2be6599aa.poster.avif?t=1762257626\" 